> C343-178 - What, if anything, SHOULD Wisdom do to random engravings?

Random engravings generated on the floor sometimes get a rumor
from getrumor(), and getrumor exercises/abuses wisdom based on 
the truth/falsehood of the rumor, which makes no sense if the player
never even reads the engraving.


